# Local-only, deliberately untracked.
#
# .vscode is personal editor config that was pushed by accident once. AWS.md and
# FRONTEND-BRIEF.md are working documents kept on disk but out of the repo; they
# were purged from history rather than just deleted, so nothing re-adds them.
